## What We Provide, and What We Don't

We provide sound, lighting, microphones, projectors and screens across five packages, delivered, installed and tested by our own crew. We do not provide cameras, live streaming equipment, video conferencing hardware, or an LED video wall: the largest display in our catalog is a single 60 inch LED screen on the MICE Pack, not a modular wall.

