## FAQs

### How do I know if an audio visual rental company is legitimate?

Check for real, verifiable reviews, a real trading history, and transparent pricing. We hold a 5.0 average across 8 Google reviews and have operated since 1996.

### Is a technician included when I book an AV rental company?

It depends on the package. The Wedding Pack and MICE Pack include one standard. The Basic MICE Pack offers one as a paid add on. The Eco Pack and Product Presentation Pack do not include one.

### How much does audio visual rental cost in Malaga?

Our packages range from 290 to 650 euros, ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. Every price includes delivery, setup and teardown. See exact pricing on our [packages page](/packages/).

### Do I need to collect or return the equipment myself?

No. Every package is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then collected again after your event.

### What areas do audio visual rental companies in Malaga typically cover?

Our own service area covers Malaga and 23 towns across the Costa del Sol, extending to Sevilla and Granada for larger bookings. Confirm the real coverage area with any company before you book.

### What equipment do audio visual rental companies typically provide?

Sound systems, lighting, microphones, projectors and screens. We do not provide cameras, live streaming equipment or video conferencing hardware, and our largest display is a single 60 inch LED screen, not a video wall.

### How far in advance should I book an audio visual rental company?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
